  "content": "Bāhuṃ sahassamabhinimmita-sāvudhantaṃGirimekhalaṃ uditaghora-sasenamāraṃDānādi-dhamma-vidhinā jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Mārātirekamabhiyujjhita-sabba-rattiṃGhorampaṇāḷavakamakkhama-thaddha-yakkhaṃKhantī-sudanta-vidhinā jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Nāḷāgiriṃ gajavaraṃ atimatta-bhūtaṃDāvaggi-cakkamasanīva sudāruṇantaṃMettambuseka-vidhinā jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Ukkhitta-khaggam-atihattha-sudāruṇantaṃDhāvantiyojanapathaṅgulimālavantaṃIddhībhisaṅkhata-mano jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Katvāna kaṭṭhamudaraṃ iva gabbhiniyāCiñcāya duṭṭhavacanaṃ janakāya-majjheSantena soma-vidhinā jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Saccaṃ vihāya mati-saccaka-vāda-ketuṃVādābhiropita-manaṃ ati-andha-bhūtaṃPaññā-padīpa-jalito jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Nandopananda-bhujagaṃ vibudhaṃ mahiddhiṃPuttena thera-bhujagena damāpayantoIddhūpadesa-vidhinā jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Duggāha-diṭṭhi-bhujagena sudaṭṭha-hattaṃBrahmaṃ visuddhi-jutimiddhi-BakābhidhānaṃÑāṇāgadena vidhinā jitavā MunindoTaṃ tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni.Etāpi Buddha-jaya-maṅgala-aṭṭhagāthāYo vācako dine-dine sarate matandīHitvāna neka-vividhāni cupaddavāniMokkhaṃ sukhaṃ adhigameyya naro sapañño.",
